  "reading": "Not like-for-like: the E40 share is the fraction of province-quarters flagged HIGH by a relative (window-percentile) rule, not a household prevalence. The references bound what an absolute food-insecurity rate looks like (FIES 31-33% national; SWS hunger 22-23% national in 2026; CALABARZON poverty 8-10%). A province-quarter HIGH share of 11% says the label marks the upper tail of the region's own 2021-2022 experience, not that 11% of households are food insecure.",
